<figure class="request-paths" aria-labelledby="request-paths-title" aria-describedby="request-paths-description">
  <figcaption id="request-paths-title">One Gateway endpoint, two request paths</figcaption>
  <p id="request-paths-description" class="request-paths__intro">
    Read from top to bottom. Both requests use the same entry point; the method determines their destination.
  </p>

  <div class="request-paths__client">
    <svg class="request-paths__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M5 4h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H9l-5 3v-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" />
      <path d="M7 9h10M7 13h6" />
    </svg>
    <div>
      <strong>OpenShift Lightspeed</strong>
      <span>Sends an MCP request</span>
    </div>
    <code>POST /mcp</code>
  </div>

  <div class="request-paths__entry">
    <span class="request-paths__down" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span>Through the <code>mcp</code> listener</span>
  </div>

  <div class="request-paths__processing" aria-label="Envoy consults the MCP router before forwarding the request">
    <div class="request-paths__envoy">
      <strong>Gateway proxy</strong>
      <span class="request-paths__engine">Envoy</span>
      <p>Receives and forwards the request</p>
    </div>

    <div class="request-paths__exchange" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Inspect</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 64 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
        <path d="M2 8h58m-6-6 6 6-6 6M62 24H4m6-6-6 6 6 6" />
      </svg>
      <span>Return</span>
    </div>

    <div class="request-paths__router">
      <strong>MCP router</strong>
      <span class="request-paths__engine"><code>ext_proc</code></span>
      <p>Reads the method and sets routing information</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="request-paths__branch">
    <p>Envoy matches the route, then forwards the request</p>
    <span class="request-paths__trunk" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="request-paths__crossbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="request-paths__outlet request-paths__outlet--list" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="request-paths__outlet request-paths__outlet--call" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="request-paths__columns">
    <section class="request-paths__path request-paths__path--list" aria-labelledby="list-path-title">
      <header>
        <span class="request-paths__number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <div>
          <strong id="list-path-title">Discover tools</strong>
          <code>tools/list</code>
        </div>
      </header>
      <ol class="request-paths__steps">
        <li class="request-paths__routing">
          <span class="request-paths__label">Routing information</span>
          <strong>Keep the Gateway hostname</strong>
          <p>The JSON body stays the same.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="request-paths__route">
          <span class="request-paths__label">Matching HTTPRoute</span>
          <strong><code>mcp-gateway-route</code></strong>
        </li>
        <li class="request-paths__destination">
          <span class="request-paths__label">Destination</span>
          <strong>MCP broker</strong>
          <p>Returns the combined tool catalog</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="request-paths__path request-paths__path--call" aria-labelledby="call-path-title">
      <header>
        <span class="request-paths__number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <div>
          <strong id="call-path-title">Run a tool</strong>
          <code>tools/call</code>
        </div>
      </header>
      <ol class="request-paths__steps">
        <li class="request-paths__routing">
          <span class="request-paths__label">Routing information</span>
          <strong>Set the backend hostname</strong>
          <p>Remove <code>openshift_</code> from the tool name.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="request-paths__route">
          <span class="request-paths__label">Matching HTTPRoute</span>
          <strong><code>mcp-server-test-route</code></strong>
        </li>
        <li class="request-paths__destination">
          <span class="request-paths__label">Destination</span>
          <strong>OpenShift MCP server</strong>
          <p>Runs the Pod-listing tool</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="request-paths__note">
    The router supplies routing information. Envoy carries the request to the broker or the MCP server.
  </p>
</figure>

